{
  "id": "ISA.22",
  "number": "22",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Ishacyaah 22",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wax Sii Sheegid Ku Saabsan Yeruusaalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanu waa war culus ee dooxada muujinta ku saabsan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "War maxaa idinku dhacay, oo aad dhammaantiin guryaha dushooda la korteen? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magaalada qaylada iyo bulxanku ka buuxaanay, magaalada farxadda badanay, kuwa dhexdaada lagu laayay seef laguma layn, dagaalna kuma ay dhiman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taliyayaashaadii oo dhammu way wada carareen, oo qaansola'aan iyagoo ah ayaa la xidhay. Inta lagaa helay oo dhan waa la wada xidhay in kastoo ay meel fog u carareen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed ayaan idhi, Aniga iga sii jeesta. Si qadhaadh baan u ooyi doonaa, ha isku daalinnina inaad dadkayga iiga qalbi qabowjisaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, waa maalin ay naxdin iyo kutumasho iyo isku qasnaanu Sayidka ah Rabbiga ciidammada ka iman doonaan oo ay dooxada muujinta ku dhici doonaan, waana wakhti derbiyada la dumin doono oo buuraha lagu qaylin doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer Ceelaam wuxuu qaatay gabooyihii, oo gaadhifardoodyo iyo rag fardo fuushan baa la socday, oo reer Qiirna gaashaankii buu daaha ka qaaday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay noqotay in dooxooyinkaagii ugu wacanaa gaadhifardoodyo ka buuxsameen, ragga fardooleyda ahuna waxay isku diyaariyeen iridda horteeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna wuxuu banneeyey daahii dadka Yahuudah, oo adna maalintaas waxaad aad u fiirisay hubkii guriga kaynta yiil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba waxaad aragteen in daldaloolka magaalada Daa'uud ay badan yihiin, oo waxaad isku soo wada ururiseen biyihii balliga hoose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaad tiriseen guryihii Yeruusaalem, oo waxaad guryihii u dumiseen inaad derbiga adkaysaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba biyihii balligii hore waxaad biyoxidheen uga samayseen labada derbi dhexdooda laakiinse ma aydaan fiirin kii waxan sameeyey, mana aydaan u jeedsan kii waa hore sameeyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Sayidka ah Rabbiga ciidammadu wuxuu maalintaas dadka ugu yeedhay oohin, iyo madax-xiirnaan, iyo dhar joonyad ah guntashadiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo bal eega, waxaa jira farxad iyo rayrayn, dibi la qalo iyo ido la gowraco, hilib la cuno iyo khamri la cabbo, oo waxaa la yidhaahdaa, Aynu wax cunno oo cabno, waayo, berrito waynu dhiman doonaaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbiga ciidammada ayaa waxan dhegaha ii saaray. Sida xaqiiqada ah xumaantan laydinkama maydhi doono jeeraad dhimataan, ayaa Sayidka ah Rabbiga ciidammadu leeyahay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka ah Rabbiga ciidammadu wuxuu leeyahay, Kac, oo waxaad u tagtaa Shebnaa oo ah khasnajiga guriga u sarreeya, oo waxaad ku tidhaahdaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waadiga qabrigaagii halkan ka qotay, oo xabaashaadiina meel sare ka qotay, oo dhagaxana hoy ka samaystay, bal maxaad halkan ku samaynaysaa? Oo yaad halkan ku haysataa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal eeg, ninka xoogga badanow, Rabbigu xoog buu kuu tuuri doonaa. Aad buu kuu qaban doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo hubaal sida kubbad oo kale ayuu kugu wadhfin doonaa dhul weyn oo ballaadhan, oo halkaasaad ku dhiman doontaa, oo gaadhifardoodyadii sharaftaaduna halkaasay joogi doonaan, adigoo ah ceebta gurigii sayidkaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaan kaa eryi doonaa derejadaada, oo jagada aad joogtona isagaa kaa soo dejin doona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaan maalintaas u yeedhi doonaa addoonkayga Elyaaqiim ina Xilqiyaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaan isaga huwin doonaa shuluggaaga, oo waxaan ku adkayn doonaa dhex-xidhkaaga, oo dowladnimadaada isagaan u dhiibi doonaa, oo isna aabbe buu dadka Yeruusaalem deggan iyo reer Yahuudah u noqon doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo furihii guriga Daa'uudna garbihiisaan saari doonaa, oo wuu furi doonaa, oo ninna ma xidhi doono, wuu xidhi doonaa, oo ninna ma furi doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaan isaga u dhuujin doonaa sida dhidib meel adag haysta, oo isna wuxuu reerka aabbihiis u noqon doonaa carshi sharaf badan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaa korkiisa laga lalmin doonaa sharaftii reerka aabbiihiis oo dhan, dhasha iyo farcanka, iyo weelasha yaryar oo dhan, koobabka iyo xataa sibraarrada waaweyn oo dhanba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbiga ciidammadu wuxuu leeyahay, Maalintaas dhidibkii meesha adag ku dhuuqsanaa wuu ka siibmi doonaa, oo intuu jabo ayuu dhici doonaa, oo culayskii saarnaana waa la baabbi'in doonaa, waayo, Rabbiga ayaa saas ku hadlay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
